"B<CLONE_PIDFD> was specified together with B<CLONE_THREAD> in the I<flags> "
"mask."
msgstr "W masce I<flags> podano B<CLONE_PIDFD> jednocześnie z B<CLONE_THREAD>."

#. type: TP
